    "scriptCode": "float M  = A;\nfloat T0 = min(B, 0.95) * sin(C * t);\nfloat K  = U*U - T0*T0;\nfloat r  = solveKruskalR(K, M);\nfloat gXX = (32.0*M*M*M / r) * exp(-r/(2.0*M));\nfloat gpp = r * r;\nreturn mat3(gXX, 0.0, 0.0,\n            0.0, gpp, 0.0,\n            0.0, 0.0, 1.0);\n",
